  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"310\"><strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"308\">Product Description:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"626\">This <strong data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"344\">macrame rectangle basket</strong> is meticulously handcrafted using natural cotton rope, offering both functionality and aesthetic charm. With its soft woven structure and sturdy rectangular frame, this basket is ideal for organizing towels, baby products, cosmetics, magazines, or decorative items around the home.</p>\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"877\">Each basket is made by skilled artisans in Vietnam who apply traditional knotting techniques passed down through generations. The macrame weave brings a warm, bohemian touch to any space — from modern homes to eco-conscious boutiques or hotel rooms.</p>\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1009\">Available in various sizes and colors. We support <strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"953\">OEM &amp; ODM production</strong> for wholesalers, retailers, and global homeware brands.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1038\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1038\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1390\">\n<li data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1084\">Handcrafted from <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1082\">natural cotton rope</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1132\">Soft-touch yet structured rectangular frame</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1218\">\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1218\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1216\">organizing or decorating shelves, bathrooms, nurseries, or stores</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1272\">\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1272\">Eco-friendly, <strong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1252\">biodegradable</strong>, and plastic-free</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1333\">\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1333\">Made by Vietnamese artisans using <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1331\">macrame techniques</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1390\">\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1390\">Custom sizes, colors, and branding available (OEM/ODM)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1395\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1431\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1429\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1579\">We welcome inquiries from wholesalers, importers, and retailers.<br data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1499\" />📧 Contact us at: <strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1544\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1542\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong><br data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1547\" />🌐 Website: <strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1579\"><a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1577\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></strong></p>",
